Required Notice: Copyright (c) 2026 Peter D Bethke

(The line above begins with `Required Notice:` deliberately -- see the
Notices section of the licence. It must travel with any copy of this
software or any part of it.)

Why this licence
----------------

kirby-cost is a Python port of the HERO Designer cost engine. The intent of
choosing a noncommercial licence is explicit: nobody should be able to build a
paid product on this work, because doing so would compete with HERO Designer
and with Hero Games' interests.

The Elastic License 2.0 was considered and rejected for this purpose. ELv2's
only commercial limitation is against offering the software as a hosted or
managed service; it permits selling a non-hosted product outright. That does
not serve the intent above.

Third-party rights this licence does NOT grant
-----------------------------------------------

This work derives from HERO Designer source licensed from CompNet Design, Inc.
That licence grants personal use and modification; distribution is separately
gated on licensing with HERO Games. Nothing in this file grants, or purports to
grant, any right in HERO Designer's source, in the HERO System rules, or in any
Hero Games property.

kirby-cost ships NO Hero Games data. It requires the operator to supply their
own licensed HERO Designer template (for example Main6E.hdt). Running this
software without such a licence is the operator's responsibility.

HERO System and HERO Designer are the property of their respective owners.
